# Steel OS (STEEL-35, STEEL-51): apps copied onto the ISO and onto the disk
# during install, so they are there at first login. Free and open-source
# apps only: putting a copy of a proprietary app on our ISO would be
# redistributing it. Proprietary defaults (Obsidian) are installed after the
# first boot from Flathub instead, by steel-os-flatpak-install.
#
# Only the two everyone needs at first login (T, 2026-10-18): every app here
# is downloaded again for every installer build and makes the download
# bigger. Zed and the other defaults install after the first boot; OBS
# Studio, Kdenlive and Moonlight are one click in the Steel OS Portal.
